                    </span>
                    <span class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                        <i data-lucide="mail" class="dt-icon-16 text-primary"></i>
                        <span>Email liên hệ: <strong>Datt68045@gmail.com</strong></span>
                    </span>
                </div>
